                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "One Hit KO is the same style of game as One Finger Death Punch. \n\nUnfortunately, it's not nearly as good because its stripped away all the extras that made Death Punch interesting. \n\nSo you're left with what essentially is 1 level (And a hard mode), a bunch of unlockable avatars that all play exactly the same and one music track that just loops over and over. leaving you with a rather bland and repetative experience.\n\nI was hoping for more. It's a real shame, I really wanted this to be good.\n\nOne Hit Death Punch is cheaper, and has more content and replayabilty.\n\nYou can check out my full video here https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-giK0qfA-w4",
